Mac-oriented SLM check, ask, validate, and receipt-check wrappers

Usage: bitnet mac [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  models                List Apple M4 model states, cache status, and selection guidance
  status                Summarize Apple M4 dense SLM, BitNet, disk/cache, receipt, and command readiness
  evidence              Summarize committed M4 evidence, cache/disk state, regressions, and next command
  report-refresh        Generate a model-free advisory/nightly Apple M4 report refresh manifest
  regression-dashboard  Build a model-free dense SLM and BitNet regression dashboard from committed reports
  check                 Check the cached Apple M4 SLM model artifact and routing boundary
  ask                   Ask one question through the Rust-native Apple M4 CPU/NEON SLM path
  smoke                 Run a compact Apple M4 model-family health smoke with cache and receipt checks
  bitnet-warm           Run BitNet prompts in one warm Apple M4 CPU/NEON process without enabling chat
  bitnet-chat-gate      Evaluate the receipt-backed gate for future BitNet Mac chat without enabling chat
  bitnet-serve-gate     Evaluate the receipt-backed gate for future BitNet Mac serve
  bitnet-benchmark      Benchmark BitNet one-shot ask and fixed warm paths without enabling chat or serve
  doctor                Run one local health verdict for the supported Apple M4 dense-SLM path
  serve                 Serve local M4 health and readiness endpoints plus completions
  serve-check           Check a running M4 local server readiness and optional completion/receipt export
  chat                  Run multiple prompts in one resident Apple M4 CPU/NEON SLM session
  chat-smoke            Run a fixed dense SLM resident chat conformance smoke and write a receipt
  validate              Run the supported SLM quality corpus in one warm Apple M4 CPU/NEON session
  eval                  Dry-run supported Apple M4 eval suites and write receipt-backed summaries
  benchmark             Run release-mode dense SLM benchmark profiles for v2 M4 receipts
  benchmark-preflight   Record benchmark environment preflight evidence without running model inference
  bitnet-proof          Validate M4 BitNet proof inputs without enabling BitNet chat/serve routing
  receipts-check        Check Apple M4 SLM answer/warm-session receipts for hidden fallback or overclaims
  regression            Compare Apple M4 dense-SLM or BitNet receipts against a stored local envelope
  help                  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -c, --config <PATH>      Configuration file path
  -d, --device <DEVICE>    Device/backend label (cpu, cuda/gpu, hip/rocm, oneapi, npu/openvino-npu, nvidia-rtx-5070-ti-cuda/wgpu, metal/mpsgraph, apple-m4-metal, apple-m4-mpsgraph, apple-m4-cpu-neon, apple-m3-air-metal, apple-m3-air-mpsgraph, apple-m3-air-cpu-neon, auto). Apple M4 and M3 Air labels are distinct proof lanes
      --log-level <LEVEL>  Log level (trace, debug, info, warn, error)
      --threads <N>        Number of CPU threads
      --batch-size <SIZE>  Batch size for processing
  -h, --help               Print help
